<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on Zeneca Group.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on Zeneca Group.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued one million American-style call warrants, on Zeneca Group ordinary shares, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    18.25 STG		 PREMIUM B/E  12 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.20 STG		  GEARING	8.3 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	27.FEB.98		 PAYDATE	06.MAR.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   LONDON		    MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  18.25 STG</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
